      "content": "PICCOTT'S END 1. 5252                                                   (East Side)                                                   Nos 94, 96 and 104                                                   (Formerly listed as                                                   Nos 43 to 47 (odd)) TL 0508 3/204             20.5.54. II             GV 2. C17.  Timber framed with colour washed brick nogging.  Old tiled roof with gable end to left side elevation.  2 storeys, 4 casement windows, some with lattice work.  Until recently divided into 3 cottages, now 1 house. Nos 92 to 96 (even) and No 104 form a group. Listing NGR: TL0528008921"
